{"id":28109,"slug":"carnal-knowledge","title":"Carnal Knowledge","year":1971,"country":"United States","duration":98,"spine":1270,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28109-carnal-knowledge","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/201b82d800bb9b4443b122a8bd1871bf/sjja7v2DJu1ZJKnqRLZzDdPOiCb7H4_large.jpg","description":"Amid the sexual revolution and social upheaval of the early 1970s, acclaimed director Mike Nichols delivered a zeitgeist-defining examination of American mores. Sharply written by Jules Feiffer, this acerbic drama flashes through more than twenty years in the lives of two college buddies (Jack Nicholson and Art Garfunkel) whose casual chauvinism is all fun and games—until it’s not. As the women who suffer and see through the friends’ insecure posturing, Candice Bergen, Ann-Margret, Rita Moreno, Carol Kane, and Cynthia O’Neal form an extraordinary ensemble that gives the film its soul. So controversial it became embroiled in an obscenity case that went all the way to the Supreme Court, Carnal Knowledge remains startling for its unnervingly frank look at postwar masculinity.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Mike Nichols","slug":"mike-nichols"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jack Nicholson","role":"Jonathan","slug":"jack-nicholson"},{"actor":"Candice Bergen","role":"Susan","slug":"candice-bergen"},{"actor":"Art Garfunkel","role":"Sandy","slug":"art-garfunkel"},{"actor":"Ann-Margret","role":"Bobbie","slug":"ann-margret"},{"actor":"Rita Moreno","role":"Louise","slug":"rita-moreno"},{"actor":"Cynthia O'Neal","role":"Cindy","slug":"cynthia-o-neal"},{"actor":"Carol Kane","role":"Jennifer","slug":"carol-kane"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Mike Nichols","slug":"mike-nichols"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Mike Nichols","slug":"mike-nichols"},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Joseph E. Levine","slug":null},{"role":"Associate producer","person":"Clive Reed","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay by","person":"Jules Feiffer","s